# C8-01 — the gauntlet's C8 vector: "a selection manifest matched without
# evaluation." The manifest's type is the selections stratum's `selection`
# record; the match is pure identity + admission; the reason enum, the
# prefix, the intent name inside are inert cargo. No predicate ran, because
# no predicate EXISTS to run (C8, law).
name: C8-01-selection-matched-without-evaluation
dag: ../../strata/selections.ndfs scripts/selection-manifest.ndfm
contract: scripts/selection.ndfc
admit: selections
expect: verdict value.latest Express
